OL,3,ADiesel hits #2 a litre in UK for first
OL,4,Atime, RAC says, as US pressures Europe
OL,5,Ato release reserves
OL,6,
OL,7,FTransport Minister Keir Mather says the
OL,8,FUK's supply of diesel is "robust" and
OL,9,F"resilient" and the country has a wide
OL,10,Frange of sources
OL,12,FThe US is a vital supplier of diesel to
OL,13,Fthe world, while more than half of the
OL,14,FUK's diesel is imported, with 31%
OL,15,Fcoming from the US.
OL,17,FEuropean ministers have been meeting on
OL,18,FFriday to discuss the potential ban
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
