OL,3,AHundreds of French schools closed as
OL,4,Aminister says 40 head teachers injured
OL,5,Ain student protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of schools in France are
OL,8,Fclosed as students continue to protest
OL,9,Fabout a lack of teachers, overcrowded
OL,10,Fclassrooms and run-down buildings
OL,12,FThe protests started earlier this week
OL,13,Fin France's capital Paris before
OL,14,Fspreading across the country
OL,16,FEducation minister Edouard Geffray
OL,17,Ftells French media that 65 school staff
OL,18,Fhave been injured, including 40
OL,19,Fheadteachers
OL,21,FHe adds that 1,949 people were arrested
OL,22,Fon Thursday alone
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
