OL,3,AChrista Pike in critical condition
OL,4,Aafter surviving two lethal injections,
OL,5,Alawyer says
OL,6,
OL,7,FTennessee death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,8,Fis in "critical condition, receiving
OL,9,Flife-saving care" at hospital, after
OL,10,Fsurviving two lethal injection
OL,11,Fattempts, leading the state's governor
OL,12,Fto halt all executions for the year.
OL,14,F"We don't have a sense of her prognosis
OL,15,For much update on her health at the
OL,16,Fmoment," her lawyer Randy Spivey told
OL,17,Freporters on Thursday. "But we do know
OL,18,Fthat she is alive right now."
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
