OL,3,AA 'dark cloud' and 'dismal' mood: How
OL,4,Ait feels on Cornell campus right now
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder normal circumstances, Cornell
OL,7,FUniversity is a beautiful place to
OL,8,Fstudy at this time of year. Autumn
OL,9,Fleaves bring pops of colour to its
OL,10,Fstately buildings, which are set
OL,11,Fagainst the backdrop of the rolling
OL,12,Fhills of upstate New York.
OL,14,FBut students and faculty members say
OL,15,Fthe investigation into an alleged gang
OL,16,Frape that took place on these grounds
OL,17,Ftwo years ago has cast a "dark cloud"
OL,18,Fover the campus - stirring anger,
OL,19,Fconcern over fraternity culture, and a
OL,20,Fbacklash against the university's
OL,21,Fhandling of the situation.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
