OL,3,AA 'dark cloud' and 'dismal' mood: How
OL,4,Ait feels on Cornell campus right now
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents and staff at the Ivy League
OL,7,Funiversity spoke to the BBC, some on
OL,8,Fcondition of anonymity, saying the
OL,9,Ftension on campus had become palpable
OL,10,Fsince the 2024 case resurfaced in
OL,11,Frecent weeks.
OL,13,FAt a student assembly on Thursday,
OL,14,Fwhich was organised to allow students
OL,15,Fto voice their concerns, many called
OL,16,Ffor drastic change at the university.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
